d cause undue suffering  so there you go there's a brief  introduction in  the world of DNA deoxyribonucleic acid  if you're in my biology class you know  pause the video try to answer these five  questions you know write your answers on  a separate sheet of paper I'd be happy  to check them for accuracy good luck
 

